<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Elsag Bailey Process Automation, Lehigh Group, Cali Realty.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Elsag Bailey Process Automation, Lehigh Group, Cali Realty.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Tuesday Elsag Bailey Process Automation NV, Lehigh Group Inc, and Cali Realty Corp were unavailable for news.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA was also unavailable for after-hours trading.</p>
</text>
